{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Geamana Village</strong> is a slow-paced, atmospheric investigative experience that invites you to explore a devastated place.\u00a0As you make your way through the last isolated homes spared by the flood, you\u2019ll speak with the few remaining locals, examine abandoned belongings, and uncover fragments of a life once lived. In the distance, the remnants of the village church still stand, silent, damaged, and waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigative Photography</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the ruins, the toxic lake, and haunting traces of the disaster. Each photo serves as both evidence and memory, revealing details overlooked by the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/ae52a14feed989fd54e140481706fe89.poster.avif?t=1773781232\" width=1000 height=563 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/ae52a14feed989fd54e140481706fe89.webm?t=1773781232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interview Locals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with the last remaining locals. Their trust must be earned and their stories often conflict, leaving you to decide what to believe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/40a4040bfc7692afb515f1c389611664.poster.avif?t=1773781232\" width=950 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/40a4040bfc7692afb515f1c389611664.webm?t=1773781232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for Clues</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find letters, reports, personal notes, and official documents scattered across the village. Every page is a missing piece of the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/e46bf3d1bb0125dc5699ad124d8846bd.poster.avif?t=1773781232\" width=950 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/e46bf3d1bb0125dc5699ad124d8846bd.webm?t=1773781232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Trust, Unlock Stories</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help locals with small tasks. Only those who trust you will share their deepest memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/01442d8e2fac82238310d2cc8c46ec97.poster.avif?t=1773781232\" width=950 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/01442d8e2fac82238310d2cc8c46ec97.webm?t=1773781232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore at Your Own Pace</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk at your own rhythm through a quiet, haunting space shaped by memory, silence, and irreversible damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/0deb0116d94f6e2f821d4db4be5cb026.poster.avif?t=1773781232\" width=950 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/0deb0116d94f6e2f821d4db4be5cb026.webm?t=1773781232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story buried under poison and silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1977, during communist rule, mining operations poisoned an entire valley. Toxic water was released without warning, swallowing homes overnight. Families fled or vanished, and a once-thriving village was drowned beneath a lake of waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years later, Moloce Arcip, a former journalist desperate for redemption, hears a radio report about a forgotten village, and sees one last chance to rebuild his career and uncover a story the world tried to erase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with your camera and a notebook,<strong>\u00a0</strong>you set out to document the traces of what remains. Silence rules the empty streets. A few locals remain, clinging to their homes despite the danger. The spire of the church still juts from the toxic lake, a lonely monument to everything that was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by true events. Step into a story buried for 20 years.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815000/2f6e614987f0830f8918ddea7feee487f36c5ed2.jpg"},{"name":"Borsh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815000/b63a44c4703062c6fd0a38903822e662415aa0d4.jpg"},{"name":"Lock pick master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815000/09f9dd2ed013eeb65085e3804a5c9db411aafe4e.jpg"},{"name":"First of many","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815000/2ecfa8496aec0e259c022336f28a50f1d44db710.jpg"},{"name":"Good boy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815000/d4b13551c81d8913da680f7cbbbcdbf48d8a17ec.jpg"},{"name":"Fried chicken shack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815000/e26e9e4b281112f659788b004229885fa4065a8e.jpg"},{"name":"Best Seller!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815000/55ed2f4dd75e00f9002e04259a5beecb031daeee.jpg"},{"name":"Secret ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815000/91e265a895f2df6e5fe3c05238954dda8fab4270.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815000?t=1773781232","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815000?t=1773781232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/3a1eeeb3dac4ee60bf832b9420c64070eb7d14f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773781232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/3a1eeeb3dac4ee60bf832b9420c64070eb7d14f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773781232","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4051480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Geamana Village</strong> is a slow-paced, atmospheric investigative experience that invites you to explore a devastated place.\u00a0As you make your way through the last isolated homes spared by the flood, you\u2019ll speak with the few remaining locals, examine abandoned belongings, and uncover fragments of a life once lived. In the distance, the remnants of the village church still stand, silent, damaged, and waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigative Photography</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the ruins, the toxic lake, and haunting traces of the disaster. Each photo serves as both evidence and memory, revealing details overlooked by the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/ae52a14feed989fd54e140481706fe89.poster.avif?t=1773781232\" width=1000 height=563 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/ae52a14feed989fd54e140481706fe89.webm?t=1773781232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interview Locals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with the last remaining locals. Their trust must be earned and their stories often conflict, leaving you to decide what to believe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/40a4040bfc7692afb515f1c389611664.poster.avif?t=1773781232\" width=950 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/40a4040bfc7692afb515f1c389611664.webm?t=1773781232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for Clues</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find letters, reports, personal notes, and official documents scattered across the village. Every page is a missing piece of the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/e46bf3d1bb0125dc5699ad124d8846bd.poster.avif?t=1773781232\" width=950 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/e46bf3d1bb0125dc5699ad124d8846bd.webm?t=1773781232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Trust, Unlock Stories</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help locals with small tasks. Only those who trust you will share their deepest memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/01442d8e2fac82238310d2cc8c46ec97.poster.avif?t=1773781232\" width=950 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/01442d8e2fac82238310d2cc8c46ec97.webm?t=1773781232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore at Your Own Pace</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk at your own rhythm through a quiet, haunting space shaped by memory, silence, and irreversible damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/0deb0116d94f6e2f821d4db4be5cb026.poster.avif?t=1773781232\" width=950 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/extras/0deb0116d94f6e2f821d4db4be5cb026.webm?t=1773781232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story buried under poison and silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1977, during communist rule, mining operations poisoned an entire valley. Toxic water was released without warning, swallowing homes overnight. Families fled or vanished, and a once-thriving village was drowned beneath a lake of waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years later, Moloce Arcip, a former journalist desperate for redemption, hears a radio report about a forgotten village, and sees one last chance to rebuild his career and uncover a story the world tried to erase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with your camera and a notebook,<strong>\u00a0</strong>you set out to document the traces of what remains. Silence rules the empty streets. A few locals remain, clinging to their homes despite the danger. The spire of the church still juts from the toxic lake, a lonely monument to everything that was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by true events. Step into a story buried for 20 years.</p>","developers":["Chainwolf Studio","Otozip"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815000/468e0d82b408f926c39166349c391d171f81fd0e/header.jpg?t=1773781232","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3815000/1267877834/908d09e148b6a9aa3ac42a61aa24d9bb47d41bde/1754144468/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754585136","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3815000/1267877834/908d09e148b6a9aa3ac42a61aa24d9bb47d41bde/1754144468/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754585136","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3815000/1267877834/908d09e148b6a9aa3ac42a61aa24d9bb47d41bde/1754144468/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754585136","id":257155645,"name":"Geamana Village - Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155645/b03c3095d6188d4f66ecbbc316166d1989fe7fee/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754585136"}],"name":"Geamana Village","pac